Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}By the end of 1918, influenza, and the pneumonia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:08.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}that came with it, had killed about 45,000 American
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}soldiers.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1160 0 l 1160 132 l 0 132{\p0}
