Dialogue: 3,0:05:54.88,0:06:00.63,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918–1919 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.07,0:07:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}CDC lists what they had. Isolation. Quarantine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:02.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Good hygiene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:03.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Disinfectants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:05.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And limits on public gatherings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They were applied unevenly.
