Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.47,0:07:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In Seattle, police officers wore masks made by the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:13.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}local Red Cross chapter.
