Dialogue: 3,0:07:08.72,0:07:13.46,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}POLICE IN MASKS MADE BY THE SEATTLE RED CROSS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.87,0:07:47.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And then came a third wave, in the winter and spring
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}of 1919, adding to the death toll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.67,0:07:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}CDC says the pandemic had subsided by that summer.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:44.12,0:07:49.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1038 0 l 1038 132 l 0 132{\p0}
