Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.13,0:09:08.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Today, flu shots are an annual requirement for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.95,0:09:09.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}military members.
