Dialogue: 3,0:09:06.38,0:09:10.39,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FLU DRIVE · CAMP CARROLL, REPUBLIC OF KOREA
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:13.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And military labs, like this Air Force epidemiology
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}lab, test samples sent in from military treatment
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}facilities around the world.
