Dialogue: 3,0:09:10.69,0:09:16.44,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}EPIDEMIOLOGY LABORATORY · USAF SCHOOL OF AEROSPACE MEDICINE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:21.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This fall, flu activity rose early.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.54,0:09:24.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In late October, CDC said the weekly flu
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:27.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hospitalization rate was the highest for that week
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.59,0:09:29.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}since the 2010-11 season.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:31.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Activity was still low overall.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:19.44,0:09:25.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 998 0 l 998 132 l 0 132{\p0}
